{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月24日 18:56 星期二</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>法新社報道，英國衛生安全局（UKHSA）周二（24日）發表初步推算報告指出，英格蘭今夏錄得5258宗與高溫天氣相關的死亡個案，創下有紀錄以來最高。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>英國今年經歷有紀錄以來最炎熱的夏天，UKHSA在報告中形容2026年夏季情况異常，5258人因高溫死亡，是自2016年有相關統計以來最高紀錄。</p><h2>（法新社）</h2></div><p>相關字詞﹕英格蘭 高溫天氣 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.232594+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:56:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T13:57:31.596994+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:26.626604+00:00","content_hash":"65d6b2891ec85544e138a84030eb1fa7aff57ac957a6da9c7d0aa16254e8b5a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}